\ the He 111 H: a fuselage of nine rings ending in the stepless glazed nose, glazed all round from its tip back 2.2 m, and the offset nose gun; the dorsal hood on the fuselage's top, low, rounded and glazed, open at its rear, its MG 15 out of it; the ventral gondola under the wing, a faired body with a window each side, its rear glazed and its MG 15 out of it; a gunner's window each side of the fuselage with its MG 15; low wings with the leading edge swept back from the nacelles, the trailing edge straight, rounded tips and the hinge line; the Jumo 211s close beside the nose, low on the wing, with three-blade propellers and two bulges under each nacelle; the rounded tailplane, the fin with its broad rounded top and the rudder; the tail wheel on its fork; the aerial from an upright mast on the fuselage to the fin; the crosses, sized to fit their surfaces, and the swastikas on the fins; the glazing in glass's colour. The span and length are published; the wing, the engines and the tailplane in plan are measured from a plan view scaled to them, the fuselage's profile, the nose, the hood, the mast, the gondola, the fin, the tail wheel and the heights of the wing and engines from a side profile scaled to the length; every other figure is an estimate
: heinkel-111 ( -- model )
	new-model-sketch luftwaffe-under-colour :under-colour ! 0.5 :under-turn ! to model
	model@faces size to first-face
	model@points size to first-point
	[ [ 8.2 0.15 0.15 0 ] [ 7.6 0.6 0.6 -0.05 ] [ 6.8 0.85 0.85 0 ] [ 6.4 0.9 0.9 0.025 ] [ 6.0 0.95 0.95 0.05 ] [ 5.5 0.95 0.95 0.05 ] [ 5.0 0.95 0.95 0.05 ] [ 2.5 0.95 0.95 0.05 ]
	  [ -1.0 0.85 0.95 0.05 ] [ -4.0 0.6 0.72 0.0 ] [ -6.8 0.28 0.31 0.0 ] [ -8.2 0.1 0.1 -0.07 ] ] to rings
	model rings [ 0 0 0 ] 8 sketch-body
	[ 0.2 0.08 ] to nose-offsets
	0 16 1 do k
		first-point k + to index
		model@points model@points index @i [ nose-offsets k 8 / round-down @i 0 0 ] v+ index !i drop
	loop
	[ 0 24 1 do k first-face k + loop [ 24 25 30 31 32 33 38 39 ] ( offset | first-face offset + ) map spread first-face 88 + ] ( face | model@faces face @i glass-colour add-last! drop ) each
	model [ [ 0.2 0.2 8.0 ] [ 0.25 0.15 8.7 ] ] sketch-path
	model rings [ [ 3.85 0.02 0.25 ] [ 3.72 0.17 0.3 ] [ 3.58 0.26 0.33 ] [ 3.44 0.3 0.34 ] [ 2.67 0.3 0.34 ] [ 2.47 0.28 0.33 ] [ 2.09 0.26 0.32 ] ] sketch-gun-hood
	rings 2.35 body-top 0.1 + to breech-height
	model [ 0 breech-height 2.85 ] [ 0 breech-height 1.42 ] 0.06 model-ink sketch-rod
	model@faces size to gondola-first-face
	[ [ 2.24 0.05 0.05 -0.95 ] [ 1.9 0.4 0.25 -1.16 ] [ 0.1 0.4 0.25 -1.16 ] [ -0.05 0.3 0.15 -1.1 ] ] to gondola
	model gondola [ 0 0 0 ] 8 sketch-body
	model@faces gondola-first-face 25 + @i glass-colour add-last! drop
	model [ 0 -1.18 0.4 ] [ 0 -1.18 -0.58 ] 0.06 model-ink sketch-rod
	[ -1 1 ] ( side |
		model [ [ 1.58 -1.33 ] [ 1.42 -1.33 ] [ 1.42 -1.16 ] [ 1.58 -1.16 ] ] ( place | gondola place spread side 0.01 body-side-point ) map
		[ 0 -1.16 1.5 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
		model [ [ 1.01 0.16 ] [ 0.49 0.16 ] [ 0.49 0.52 ] [ 1.01 0.52 ] ] ( place | rings place spread side 0.01 body-side-point ) map
		[ 0 0.34 0.75 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
		model [ side 0.6 * 0.34 0.85 ] [ rings 0.6 0.34 side 0.15 body-side-point first 0.36 0.45 ] 0.04 model-ink sketch-rod
	) each
	model [ [ 0.7 6.0 ] [ 3.8 5.8 ] [ 8.0 4.8 ] [ 9.8 4.2 ] [ 10.8 3.7 ] [ 11.3 3.0 ] [ 11.3 2.3 ] [ 10.9 1.8 ] [ 10.0 1.55 ] [ 8.0 1.5 ] [ 3.8 1.3 ] [ 2.0 1.1 ] [ 1.6 1.25 ] [ 1.35 1.5 ] [ 0.7 1.75 ] ]
		[ [ [ 3.8 2.0 ] [ 10.2 2.0 ] ] [ [ 7.2 1.5 ] [ 7.2 2.0 ] ] ] 0.044 -0.45 sketch-surface
	model 2.8 -0.48 7.45 [ [ 0 0.62 ] [ -0.7 0.72 ] [ -3.8 0.62 ] [ -5.2 0.42 ] [ -6.45 0 ] ] 1.75 bomber-spinner sketch-engines
	[ -1 1 ] ( side |
		[ [ [ 6.5 0.15 0.05 -1.05 ] [ 6.2 0.33 0.2 -1.1 ] [ 5.9 0.35 0.22 -1.1 ] [ 5.5 0.25 0.1 -1.1 ] ]
		  [ [ 5.5 0.25 0.1 -1.1 ] [ 4.8 0.35 0.2 -1.12 ] [ 3.3 0.35 0.2 -1.12 ] [ 2.6 0.1 0.05 -1.0 ] ] ] ( bulge |
			model bulge [ side 2.8 * 0 0 ] 8 sketch-body
		) each
	) each
	model [ [ 0.5 -5.4 ] [ 2.0 -5.6 ] [ 3.2 -6.0 ] [ 3.9 -6.6 ] [ 3.9 -7.1 ] [ 3.2 -7.5 ] [ 0.5 -7.6 ] ] [ [ [ 0.5 -7.05 ] [ 3.8 -7.05 ] ] ] 0 0.1 sketch-surface
