	  { :name "TIRPITZ AT TRONDHEIM, 5 MARCH 1942" :month 3 :snow-line 0
	    :story [ "5 MARCH 1942. THE TIRPITZ LIES IN FAETTENFJORD BY TRONDHEIM."
	             "FLY THE UNARMED PR SPITFIRE 580 MILES FROM WICK, PHOTOGRAPH"
