	    :start [ tug-start firing-course 150 300 -1500 placed firing-course 70 false ]
	    :raid null :tug-start tug-start :tug-course firing-course
	    :night false :landing false :visibility clear-visibility :cover 0.15 :base 2600 :wind [ 250 6 ]
	    :propeller :constant-speed :emergency true :lesson true :air-firing true
	    :message ""
	    :group :training
	    :briefing "FIVE STEPS: RANGING ON THE TUG WITH THE SIGHT'S BARS, AN ASTERN ATTACK ON THE DROGUE, A QUARTER ATTACK, A TURNING TARGET, AND YOUR TOTALS. A SECOND AFTER YOU LET GO OF THE TRIGGER THE INSTRUCTOR ASSESSES THE BURST: ITS RANGE, ANGLE OFF AND HITS, THE LEAD IT NEEDED AND THE LEAD YOU GAVE, AND WHERE YOUR AIM WAS. THE DROGUE'S RANGE IS IN THE STRIP BELOW THE PANEL. THE GUNS ARE FILLED FOR EACH EXERCISE. NEVER FIRE WITH THE TUG NEAR YOUR SIGHT." }
	  { :name "FREE FLIGHT FROM TURNHOUSE"
